          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 91 SW              MARSWORTH         VICARAGE ROAD 6/114                                   Nos. 98 and 100. - GV                                      II House and cottage.  C17- early C18, altered.  Timber frame with brick infill, ground floor rebuilt in brick, left gable painted black.  Old tile roof, hipped to left.  C18 brick chimney to right of third bay, C20 brick chimney to left.  2 storeys, 4 bays.  Wooden casements with single horizontal glazing bars, 3 3-light to each floor, 2-light to ground floor in left bay and centre, single light to first floor of 3rd bay.  Board doors in 2 bays to right.  Lean-to at left end with 3-light casement.  Rear also has lean-to. Listing NGR: SP9195614760"
    }
  ],
